WEBVTT

00:00.530 --> 00:01.850
Here goes nothing!

00:10.230 --> 00:13.650
Highly Accurate

00:10.230 --> 00:13.650
Astrology

00:15.430 --> 00:18.300
My horoscope today sucks!

00:18.300 --> 00:20.610
Your lucky color's red, it says.

00:20.610 --> 00:22.570
You can have my red pen, if you want.

00:22.950 --> 00:25.960
<i>The fortune-telling boom 
is upon us, it seems.</i>

00:25.960 --> 00:28.640
<i>Girls are really into that stuff, huh?</i>

00:30.090 --> 00:30.990
Hey!

00:31.310 --> 00:33.540
Let me read out yours too, Nemu-chan!

00:34.480 --> 00:38.180
Be careful not to oversleep 
today, Sagittarius.

00:38.590 --> 00:41.360
You may lose something important to you.

00:42.850 --> 00:44.540
<i>Its power...</i>

00:44.540 --> 00:46.010
<i>It's greater than I feared.</i>

00:58.660 --> 00:59.740
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

01:00.240 --> 01:01.370
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

01:03.540 --> 01:06.670
<b>Mahiro Oyama</b>

01:09.840 --> 01:12.880
<b>Mihari Oyama</b>

02:07.690 --> 02:15.990
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

02:16.490 --> 02:21.490
<b>#11  Mahiro Pretties Up</b>

02:27.730 --> 02:30.240
You're reading an astrology book?

02:30.650 --> 02:31.730
Hm?

02:31.730 --> 02:33.410
You wanna take a look?

02:33.670 --> 02:34.470
Here.

02:40.860 --> 02:43.920
I suppose girls are quite 
fond of these, huh?

02:43.920 --> 02:45.430
I-It's not that!

02:45.430 --> 02:47.430
It's been all the rage at school lately,

02:47.430 --> 02:49.760
so I just wanted to see what 
all the fuss was about!

02:49.760 --> 02:51.530
Sure, sounds plausible to me.

02:51.530 --> 02:52.640
Gimme a break!

02:53.580 --> 02:57.140
Honestly, you don't even know 
what I'm going through.

02:57.140 --> 02:58.420
Oh, hey!

02:58.420 --> 03:01.490
While you're here, why 
don't I read out yours?

03:01.490 --> 03:05.420
Let's see. You were born 
in April, so that means...

03:06.120 --> 03:07.760
Stop right there.

03:07.760 --> 03:09.610
I don't believe in astrology, anyway.

03:09.610 --> 03:11.920
Aw, you're no fun!

03:11.920 --> 03:15.590
Why don't you try reading 
another sign's horoscope?

03:15.590 --> 03:18.020
I bet you it'll still apply.

03:20.150 --> 03:22.140
Stuff like that is so generic.

03:22.140 --> 03:26.040
All they do is write things 
that could apply to anyone.

03:26.040 --> 03:28.640
Like "you have a serious side to you,"

03:28.640 --> 03:31.310
or "there's something weighing on you."

03:31.310 --> 03:33.660
It's called the Barnum effect.

03:33.660 --> 03:34.850
Hang on, what's this?

03:35.170 --> 03:37.210
To those born in the month of April,

03:37.210 --> 03:39.470
try to avoid being overly 
argumentative today.

03:39.470 --> 03:42.450
You may be annoying the people around you.

03:42.450 --> 03:44.420
See? It's got you pegged!

03:44.420 --> 03:47.650
L-Let's see what it says about, you then!

03:49.510 --> 03:51.800
An important occasion is 
right around the corner.

03:51.800 --> 03:54.070
You may be in for a surprise or two.

03:55.430 --> 03:57.380
An important occasion?

03:57.380 --> 03:58.960
Was there something coming up?

03:58.960 --> 04:01.530
Huh? Surely it's talking about—

04:03.790 --> 04:05.140
Actually, never mind.

04:05.140 --> 04:05.830
Wha?

04:11.720 --> 04:12.910
Hello, Mahiro-chan.

04:12.910 --> 04:14.520
Hey, Momi— ji?

04:18.550 --> 04:22.150
M-Momiji, have you finally 
gone to the dark side?

04:22.520 --> 04:25.610
It said an eyepatch would 
bring me luck today.

04:25.610 --> 04:27.490
That's a safety risk! Take it off!

04:31.910 --> 04:34.100
Death in the upright position.

04:34.550 --> 04:35.680
Asahi-chan...

04:36.200 --> 04:37.780
Your death is nigh.

04:38.100 --> 04:39.750
Dun-Dun-Duuun!

04:43.640 --> 04:45.820
This one's fishy, too.

04:45.820 --> 04:48.340
Each one's more absurd than the last.

04:48.340 --> 04:51.070
They're all just at that age, I guess.

04:51.070 --> 04:52.140
Bless their souls.

04:52.460 --> 04:54.840
Maybe I should learn black magic, too.

04:54.840 --> 04:55.720
Yikes!

04:56.330 --> 04:58.370
H-Hey, guys!

04:58.370 --> 05:01.390
How about we all do one that's 
a little more light-hearted?

05:01.390 --> 05:03.610
Light-hearted? Like what?

05:03.950 --> 05:05.920
Like... Um...

05:05.920 --> 05:07.880
I didn't think this far.

05:07.880 --> 05:10.660
I swear there was something 
in that book yesterday...

05:11.130 --> 05:12.030
Oh!

05:12.030 --> 05:13.630
How about animal horoscopes?!

05:13.630 --> 05:16.170
It's about finding out which animal 
best fits your personality!

05:16.460 --> 05:18.560
Cool! That sounds fun!

05:19.120 --> 05:21.030
No clue how you're supposed 
to do that, though.

05:21.030 --> 05:23.000
Guess I'll just have to improvise.

05:23.680 --> 05:26.400
Well, then, Asahi's always 
bubbly and outgoing.

05:26.400 --> 05:28.800
A dog fits her pretty 
well, don't you think?

05:30.170 --> 05:31.530
Woof, woof!

05:31.530 --> 05:33.440
I totally see it!

05:33.930 --> 05:37.020
And since Miyo-chan's so cute, 
maybe a bunny rabbit?

05:37.020 --> 05:37.630
Hoppity-hop!

05:37.630 --> 05:39.750
Oh, shush. You're making me blush!

05:39.750 --> 05:42.110
Kinda fits with her seemingly 
constant arousal, too.

05:42.590 --> 05:44.340
For Momiji, I'd say...

05:44.340 --> 05:45.670
A kokeshi doll?

05:45.670 --> 05:46.090
Koke.

05:46.090 --> 05:46.540
Huh?

05:46.540 --> 05:48.710
Scratch that! Um...

05:49.160 --> 05:50.470
What about a bear?

05:50.470 --> 05:53.340
Since you're so kind-hearted and reliable!

05:53.340 --> 05:55.790
Aw, you really think so?

05:55.790 --> 05:58.290
Plus, she can get weirdly aggressive, too.

05:59.720 --> 06:01.600
What would you be, then, Mahiro-chan?

06:02.070 --> 06:03.320
Let's see...

06:03.320 --> 06:04.970
Not to blow my own trumpet, but...

06:05.570 --> 06:07.980
with a loving soul and a big heart,

06:07.980 --> 06:11.140
nothing fits me better 
than the mighty elephant!

06:12.510 --> 06:13.390
Something wrong?

06:13.390 --> 06:14.860
Nope! Nothing at all!

06:14.860 --> 06:16.100
I know!

06:16.100 --> 06:18.380
Can I try something next?

06:18.380 --> 06:20.520
It's just a normal horoscope 
reading, though.

06:20.520 --> 06:22.160
Oh? I'm down!

06:22.970 --> 06:24.410
All right...

06:25.350 --> 06:27.830
Could you tell me your birthday, then?

06:28.590 --> 06:30.840
<i>This is a trap, Mahiro-chan!</i>

06:30.840 --> 06:34.060
<i>Reading your horoscope is merely a façade 
to get you to tell me your birthday!</i>

06:34.060 --> 06:36.320
<i>Then I can surprise you when the day comes!</i>

06:36.320 --> 06:38.540
<i>It's absolutely foolproof!</i>

06:38.540 --> 06:40.870
Oh, right, my birthday.

06:40.870 --> 06:44.020
Umm, it's March...

06:44.020 --> 06:46.380
Oh, it's today, actually.

06:47.480 --> 06:48.940
It is?!

06:48.940 --> 06:50.390
H-Happy birthday!

06:57.170 --> 06:58.860
I'm home!

06:59.260 --> 07:01.090
Happy birthday, Onii-chan!

07:01.090 --> 07:04.500
You completely forgot about it, didn't you?

07:04.500 --> 07:07.400
I guess horoscopes have 
their uses, after all.

07:08.940 --> 07:11.110
Oh, goodness! What a surprise!

07:11.110 --> 07:12.210
Talk about forced!

07:12.610 --> 07:15.670
I remembered earlier today. Sorry.

07:15.670 --> 07:18.720
Welp, so much for the element of surprise.

07:19.690 --> 07:22.200
Not quite sure how I feel right now, though.

07:22.200 --> 07:25.260
Feels weird to say I'm a year 
older when I look like this.

07:25.630 --> 07:28.380
How many candles should I put on it?

07:28.380 --> 07:29.960
That's a good question.

07:32.930 --> 07:33.140
<b>ONIMAI</b>

07:33.140 --> 07:33.300
<b>ONIMAI</b>

07:33.190 --> 07:34.570
<i>Onimai.</i>

07:33.300 --> 07:33.470
<b>ONIMAI</b>

07:33.470 --> 07:33.640
<b>ONIMAI</b>

07:33.640 --> 07:33.680
<b>ONIMAI</b>

07:33.680 --> 07:33.720
<b>ONIMAI</b>

07:33.720 --> 07:33.760
<b>ONIMAI</b>

07:33.760 --> 07:33.800
<b>ONIMAI</b>

07:33.800 --> 07:33.840
<b>ONIMAI</b>

07:33.840 --> 07:33.890
<b>ONIMAI</b>

07:33.890 --> 07:34.920
<b>ONIMAI</b>

07:40.340 --> 07:43.130
Hey, Momiji! Wanna walk home together?

07:43.130 --> 07:44.120
U-Uh...

07:44.120 --> 07:45.760
Sorry, I can't today.

07:45.760 --> 07:47.530
Huh. Okay, then.

07:47.530 --> 07:49.880
In that case... Miyo-chan!

07:49.880 --> 07:51.800
I can't either, actually...

07:51.800 --> 07:52.500
Huh?

07:52.940 --> 07:54.520
That was close.

07:54.520 --> 07:55.640
I'll see you then, okay?

07:55.640 --> 07:56.370
Sure!

07:56.370 --> 07:57.310
Wait!

07:57.310 --> 07:59.550
C-Could this mean what I think it means?!

08:00.040 --> 08:01.490
Let's throw her a birthday party!

08:01.490 --> 08:03.140
It'll be a surprise!

08:04.360 --> 08:06.740
We'll plan everything in secret, 
so she doesn't find out.

08:06.740 --> 08:09.590
But Mahiron's birthday 
already passed, didn't it?

08:09.590 --> 08:13.030
Yeah, but I'm sure she'd prefer 
this over nothing at all.

08:13.030 --> 08:14.490
I know I would, if it were me.

08:14.490 --> 08:15.570
You've got a point.

08:15.570 --> 08:19.600
Besides, this way she definitely 
won't see it coming.

08:19.910 --> 08:24.020
Who would suspect a surprise party 
when it's not even their birthday?

08:24.830 --> 08:28.440
She sounds like some 
iron-fisted TV producer.

08:28.720 --> 08:32.100
Okay, then, we'll each get her a present.

08:32.100 --> 08:34.880
And don't say a word about it 
to her until this weekend!

08:34.880 --> 08:36.040
Yes, ma'am!

08:34.880 --> 08:36.040
Okay!

08:36.040 --> 08:38.160
Or something along those lines, right?

08:38.160 --> 08:39.520
It's totally cliché!

08:39.520 --> 08:43.370
Normally, I'm supposed to get the wrong 
idea and get all depressed about it.

08:43.370 --> 08:47.180
But an experienced fellow, such as 
myself, shan't be so easily deceived.

08:48.290 --> 08:50.140
Well, if it isn't Asahi!

08:50.140 --> 08:51.590
Come on now, spill the beans.

08:51.590 --> 08:53.450
I already know what's going on.

08:55.680 --> 08:57.370
Stay away from me!

08:57.620 --> 09:01.810
I promised I wouldn't speak to you!

09:05.080 --> 09:06.840
<i>It's all over.</i>

09:23.920 --> 09:25.720
Onii-chan?

09:27.090 --> 09:28.330
Onii-chan?!

09:28.730 --> 09:31.110
Enough! It's time to get up!

09:35.720 --> 09:38.720
But I don't wanna!

09:36.790 --> 09:38.860
Quit crying on your little sister's lap!

09:40.890 --> 09:43.780
Honestly, you're such a softie sometimes.

09:43.780 --> 09:45.950
Have a little more confidence in yourself.

09:47.330 --> 09:48.770
See? That's them now.

10:00.070 --> 10:01.940
We're under attack!

10:08.080 --> 10:10.720
Happy birthday!

10:12.410 --> 10:15.380
Jeez! You guys had me so worried!

10:17.360 --> 10:19.580
Guess we can call this a success, then.

10:19.580 --> 10:22.410
Sorry, they told me not to talk to you.

10:22.410 --> 10:24.870
Asahi's a terrible liar, you know?

10:24.870 --> 10:27.230
We knew if we let her, she'd just 
end up spilling everything.

10:27.230 --> 10:28.580
Gotcha...

10:33.140 --> 10:34.530
Here you go.

10:34.530 --> 10:36.330
This present's from me.

10:37.520 --> 10:39.820
Wow, thank you!

10:40.370 --> 10:42.750
I got you a book I thought 
you might like, too.

10:42.750 --> 10:44.840
Don't open it until later, okay?

10:44.840 --> 10:46.250
Oh, of course...

10:46.510 --> 10:48.040
And I got you...

10:48.040 --> 10:48.650
This!

10:49.000 --> 10:51.580
Anything-You-Want Ticket

10:51.900 --> 10:53.940
Yup, I should've known.

10:53.940 --> 10:57.250
You can use that to get us 
all to do something for you!

10:57.250 --> 10:58.250
Huh?!

10:59.700 --> 11:01.770
That's quite the tough call to make...

11:02.650 --> 11:04.330
Hmm...

11:05.500 --> 11:07.320
Well, how about this?

11:08.390 --> 11:12.180
I hope you'll all stay friends 
with me from here on out!

11:19.850 --> 11:20.940
No...

11:20.940 --> 11:22.690
Not like that.

11:23.120 --> 11:26.060
You know, like... something more practical!

11:26.060 --> 11:27.300
Aww...

11:27.300 --> 11:30.310
I really thought you'd 
be satisfied with that.

11:30.310 --> 11:33.370
A shoulder massage, then? 
Would that make you happy?

11:33.380 --> 11:36.800
Anything-You-Want Ticket

11:33.620 --> 11:35.810
Coming right up!

11:37.060 --> 11:38.680
Rub, rub, rub.

11:38.680 --> 11:40.330
Rubba-dub-dub.

11:40.210 --> 11:42.040
Honestly...

11:40.330 --> 11:41.820
You're so stiff, you know?

11:41.820 --> 11:43.630
R-Really?

11:44.320 --> 11:46.170
This one's from all of us!

11:47.300 --> 11:48.700
Ta-da!

11:48.020 --> 11:53.980
Happy Birthday

11:49.270 --> 11:52.010
We baked a cake for you!

11:52.010 --> 11:53.980
Wow!

11:54.600 --> 11:57.270
It's a fruit cake! My idea!

11:57.270 --> 11:58.890
Oh...

11:59.430 --> 12:01.210
Is it safe to eat?

12:01.210 --> 12:03.380
It's okay. My sister supervised.

12:04.450 --> 12:07.070
Okay, then, Momiji! Can you feed it to me?

12:07.070 --> 12:08.570
Your wish is my command!

12:14.510 --> 12:16.410
Now, open wide!

12:20.410 --> 12:21.870
Delicious!

12:21.870 --> 12:23.430
I'm glad you like it!

12:23.780 --> 12:25.770
Here's some iced tea.

12:25.770 --> 12:27.990
Man, I'm thirsty.

12:27.990 --> 12:28.970
Here you go!

12:28.970 --> 12:30.420
Your drink, as requested.

12:30.750 --> 12:32.430
Turn on the TV for me, would you?

12:32.430 --> 12:34.170
I'm part of this, too?

12:36.790 --> 12:38.600
There's more if you want it.

12:39.780 --> 12:40.430
Mahiro-sama.

12:40.430 --> 12:41.490
I need the restroom.

12:41.490 --> 12:42.700
I'll go for you!

12:42.700 --> 12:44.360
Zoomy-zoom-zoom!

12:49.530 --> 12:51.700
C'mon, get out already!

12:51.700 --> 12:53.700
That's karma for you.

12:57.430 --> 13:01.420
I would have loved it if 
Kaede-chan were here too.

13:01.420 --> 13:04.540
I'm sorry. She said she had work today.

13:04.860 --> 13:06.070
Whoops, I forgot!

13:06.070 --> 13:07.910
She wanted me to give you her present!

13:08.630 --> 13:09.480
Here!

13:09.760 --> 13:11.690
Kaede-chan's the best!

13:11.690 --> 13:14.300
What could it be, I wonder...

13:14.300 --> 13:15.040
Hm?

13:15.390 --> 13:21.320
Mahiro-chan

13:15.390 --> 13:21.320
Happy Birthday

13:15.390 --> 13:21.320
Try dolling yourself up a bit

13:15.390 --> 13:21.320
Love, Kaede

13:15.760 --> 13:16.830
<i>Mahiro-chan!</i>

13:16.830 --> 13:18.400
<i>Happy birthday!</i>

13:18.400 --> 13:20.260
<i>Try dolling yourself up a bit!</i>

13:20.260 --> 13:21.330
<i>Love, Kaede.</i>

13:22.340 --> 13:24.440
What a nice lip balm!

13:24.440 --> 13:27.270
It's tinted, too! How grown-up!

13:27.270 --> 13:28.990
Y-Yeah...

13:31.120 --> 13:33.000
<b>ONIMAI</b>

13:31.260 --> 13:32.520
<i>Onimai.</i>

13:35.120 --> 13:37.000
<b>ONIMAI</b>

13:35.780 --> 13:37.000
<i>Onimai.</i>

13:52.830 --> 13:54.040
Oh, my...

13:54.040 --> 13:55.640
How precious...

13:55.640 --> 13:56.600
Huh?!

13:56.910 --> 13:58.530
I-It's not what you think!

13:58.530 --> 14:01.560
I just thought it'd be rude of 
me if I didn't use it, you know?

14:01.560 --> 14:02.760
Right, of course!

14:02.760 --> 14:05.280
If that's what you've been telling yourself!

14:06.920 --> 14:08.340
What's her problem?

14:21.800 --> 14:24.330
Good morning, Mahiro-chan!

14:24.330 --> 14:25.370
Morning!

14:25.930 --> 14:27.550
Good morning!

14:32.710 --> 14:33.900
What's up?

14:33.900 --> 14:37.290
It's just, you seem more 
grown-up today somehow.

14:37.290 --> 14:39.640
Wha?! Uh, you think so?!

14:43.060 --> 14:44.350
Aha!

14:44.350 --> 14:46.850
You're wearing the tinted 
lip balm I gave you!

14:46.850 --> 14:48.040
Yup.

14:48.040 --> 14:50.920
You know? The lip balm I 
got her for her birthday.

14:50.920 --> 14:52.500
Oh!

14:52.500 --> 14:55.910
Y-Yeah, I wasn't sure about it at first,

14:55.910 --> 14:59.000
but I thought it'd be rude if I 
didn't try it on at least once.

14:59.000 --> 15:01.050
Of course, of course! Thanks for trying it!

15:02.230 --> 15:06.060
I've always thought you 
had such lovely features!

15:10.360 --> 15:12.710
Should you ever want to 
give makeup another try,

15:12.710 --> 15:15.000
just let your big sis Kaede know, okay?

15:15.000 --> 15:16.590
O-Okay...

15:17.620 --> 15:19.230
You're so cute!

15:19.230 --> 15:21.310
I knew this color would suit you.

15:20.570 --> 15:22.010
Onee-chan!

15:22.390 --> 15:23.930
Okay, okay.

15:23.930 --> 15:26.950
Be careful at school, though, okay?

15:27.320 --> 15:30.850
Though the color's pretty faint, 
so I think you should be fine.

15:41.840 --> 15:43.670
That color's so pretty!

15:43.670 --> 15:45.790
It's so cute! What brand is it?

15:46.460 --> 15:47.460
Here.

15:47.940 --> 15:49.210
Let me see, let me see!

15:49.780 --> 15:51.570
Wow, it's so pretty!

15:51.570 --> 15:53.410
C'mon, guys! Back it up!

15:53.410 --> 15:54.880
Oh, my bad!

15:57.500 --> 15:59.910
You're my hero!

16:00.660 --> 16:03.220
I'm still not used to 
talking to trendy girls...

16:03.220 --> 16:05.470
They're really sweet once 
you get to know them.

16:05.470 --> 16:08.940
Still, everyone's really into makeup, huh?

16:10.340 --> 16:12.890
Kids our age like dressing 
up a little, you know?

16:13.240 --> 16:15.800
I couldn't care less about that stuff!

16:15.800 --> 16:18.040
Did you really have to contradict me?

16:23.620 --> 16:26.830
<i>I couldn't care less either, of course.</i>

16:27.480 --> 16:31.400
<i>But it does feel nice to have them 
fawning over me like this.</i>

16:39.230 --> 16:43.680
<i>Does putting on a little lip tint really 
warrant this much attention, though?</i>

16:43.680 --> 16:45.230
<i>Girls have such a keen eye.</i>

16:46.130 --> 16:47.870
O-Oyama!

16:48.550 --> 16:49.270
Wha?

16:49.680 --> 16:52.430
<i>Hold up! Not the boys, too?!</i>

16:52.900 --> 16:53.670
Huh?

16:54.440 --> 16:56.820
H-Here's your chocolate.

16:56.820 --> 16:59.520
You know? Since it's White Day.

16:59.520 --> 17:01.760
<i>Oh, that's why...</i>

17:01.760 --> 17:03.550
It <i>is</i> White Day, huh?

17:03.830 --> 17:06.290
I said you didn't have to, though!

17:06.290 --> 17:08.950
Still, I'd be the last one 
to turn down chocolate.

17:08.950 --> 17:10.810
S-Sure...

17:23.730 --> 17:25.750
So...

17:25.750 --> 17:27.910
Was there anything else?

17:27.910 --> 17:28.890
Wha?!

17:28.890 --> 17:31.940
Um...

17:33.310 --> 17:36.570
W-We'll go get you something better!

17:36.570 --> 17:38.550
Boys are so dense sometimes.

17:38.550 --> 17:40.000
Those jerks.

17:41.970 --> 17:45.140
Gosh, I feel like such a nag!

17:45.140 --> 17:46.180
Mahiro-chan!

17:46.940 --> 17:48.590
You're on class duty today, remember?

17:48.590 --> 17:50.550
You need to go pick up the class log.

17:50.550 --> 17:52.370
Oh, no, I forgot!

17:52.380 --> 17:55.800
<b>Faculty Office</b>

17:55.800 --> 17:57.970
<b>Japanese</b>

17:55.800 --> 17:57.970
<b>Class Log</b>

17:56.500 --> 17:57.570
Here you go.

17:57.960 --> 18:00.260
Sorry I'm late.

18:00.260 --> 18:02.430
You made it before assembly, so you're good.

18:03.510 --> 18:04.270
Hang on.

18:04.270 --> 18:06.640
Are you wearing tinted lip balm?

18:06.640 --> 18:08.270
It looks so natural on you.

18:08.640 --> 18:11.220
Oh, could you tell?

18:11.220 --> 18:13.300
I've been the talk of the 
class since this morning!

18:13.300 --> 18:15.120
But wearing makeup is against school rules.

18:16.290 --> 18:19.520
It's faint, so I'd like to 
let you off the hook, but...

18:21.590 --> 18:24.720
I understand the desire to make 
yourself look pretty, of course.

18:25.180 --> 18:26.910
You are a young lady, after all.

18:27.140 --> 18:28.980
Oh... Uh...

18:28.980 --> 18:30.320
But you don't have to worry.

18:30.320 --> 18:32.970
You're a pretty girl just 
as you are, Oyama-san.

18:34.240 --> 18:36.460
And we must look respectable at school.

18:36.460 --> 18:37.350
Yes, ma'am.

18:37.760 --> 18:39.860
Now, go to the bathroom and wipe it off.

18:39.860 --> 18:41.080
Yes, ma'am...

18:46.410 --> 18:49.480
I can't believe she treated me 
like one of the trendy girls!

18:49.480 --> 18:52.370
I think it's perfectly respectable!

18:52.370 --> 18:53.740
This is pure authoritarianism!

18:53.740 --> 18:55.140
What about self-expression?!

18:59.320 --> 19:01.320
Yeah, I know. And get this...

19:01.320 --> 19:03.490
Oh, welcome back!

19:03.770 --> 19:05.810
Wait, what happened to your lip balm?

19:05.810 --> 19:07.670
U-Um...

19:07.670 --> 19:08.870
Oh, no...

19:08.870 --> 19:11.700
Did Mari-chan-sensei find out?

19:11.700 --> 19:14.500
She doesn't look it, but 
she can be pretty strict.

19:15.840 --> 19:17.670
Welp, at least you got off easy, huh?

19:17.670 --> 19:19.000
So true!

19:20.450 --> 19:21.390
Right?!

19:21.390 --> 19:23.160
It's so unfair!

19:23.160 --> 19:24.760
Right?

19:26.540 --> 19:28.020
Are you serious?

19:28.590 --> 19:31.520
That fancy chocolate didn't cut it, huh?

19:31.520 --> 19:33.930
Girls are so hard to please...

19:35.020 --> 19:36.010
You idiots!

19:36.010 --> 19:37.110
You messed up big.

19:37.110 --> 19:39.870
Mahiro-san can't be won over so easily.

19:41.080 --> 19:43.680
You could've at least gotten 
her a luxury brand!

19:43.680 --> 19:44.820
That's what I was gonna say!

19:44.820 --> 19:46.040
What were you thinking?

19:47.320 --> 19:48.940
Boys are so...

19:48.940 --> 19:50.410
...childish.

19:59.340 --> 20:01.400
Mahiro-chan?

20:02.040 --> 20:05.140
You're not gonna put on makeup today?

20:05.140 --> 20:07.220
Knock it off, will ya?!

20:07.220 --> 20:08.390
What about you?!

20:08.390 --> 20:10.550
You wear the same outfit, day in, day out!

20:10.550 --> 20:13.060
Why don't you spruce 
yourself up for a change?!

20:13.060 --> 20:16.490
C'mon. You know that's not my thing.

20:16.490 --> 20:18.750
How many more times do I have to say it?

20:18.750 --> 20:21.140
I don't have anyone to dress up for, anyway.

20:21.140 --> 20:24.590
And I'd hate for 
people to think I'm vain.

20:24.590 --> 20:27.410
Welp, that was your last chance.

20:27.410 --> 20:29.100
There's no other way.

20:29.100 --> 20:31.380
Sensei! Do what must be done!

20:32.450 --> 20:34.790
Leave it to me!

20:35.090 --> 20:37.630
H-Have you been there this whole time?!

20:40.160 --> 20:42.340
C'mon, just roll with it!

20:42.340 --> 20:44.890
No! No way! I refuse!

20:53.100 --> 20:55.120
I'm sorry, Mihari.

20:57.140 --> 21:00.710
It's just, you skipped grades, you know?

21:01.410 --> 21:05.740
I wish we could hang out and do more 
teenage girl stuff together sometimes.

21:06.100 --> 21:07.400
Kaede...

21:08.490 --> 21:10.230
Oh, all right, then.

21:10.230 --> 21:12.670
Go on, knock yourself out.

21:12.670 --> 21:13.850
You're the best.

21:16.310 --> 21:18.160
True friendship.

21:22.120 --> 21:25.060
There! All done!

21:25.900 --> 21:28.610
You look gorgeous, Mihari!

21:33.320 --> 21:36.960
This is like, totally weird!

21:38.010 --> 21:39.670
Yay!

21:42.270 --> 21:44.910
This cannot be allowed to continue!

21:45.210 --> 21:46.960
Aw, don't say that.

21:46.960 --> 21:49.370
How about you join in on 
the fun, Mahiro-chan?

21:55.850 --> 21:57.730
Yay!

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
<b>Next Episode: Mahiro's Future as a Sister</b>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
<b>Illustration: Namori</b>

23:38.490 --> 23:39.970
See you next time!
